{
  "about": "What this agent may touch in Meta's ads connector. Every connector tool not named here is blocked. Reads run freely. Writes run only as the next step of a plan you approved with yes <code>. Budgets are worked out from each input's budget fields (Meta budgets are in cents, so divided by 100) and checked against your daily cap.",
